Prompt Engineering - what exactly it means?

Prompt Engineering is the practice of designing and refining prompts (instructions, questions, or inputs) to get the most accurate, useful, or creative responses from AI models (like ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude, etc.).

Think of it like asking the right question in the right way so the AI understands exactly what you need.

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Where It’s Used?


Software & DevOps: Asking AI to generate YAML, Terraform, or Kubernetes manifests correctly.

Business: Drafting emails, reports, or policies in the right tone.

Education: Creating quizzes, lesson plans, or explanations tailored for a student’s level.

Healthcare/Finance: Ensuring compliance and accurate outputs by framing structured queries.

